<title>JAPAN: Nissan Mutual 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nissan Mutual 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	  (in billions yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Premium income	     109.80	  vs	  118.50</p>
<p> Asset Invest Gains	  32.30	  vs	   53.30</p>
<p> Insurance Payments	 150.30	  vs	  125.40</p>
